## The shape this answer must take
`commitments` must be a STRING whose content is JSON text fitting exactly this schema (the field itself is a string, not an object):
{
  "properties": {
    "cell": {
      "minLength": 3,
      "type": "string"
    },
    "expect": {
      "enum": [
        "moves",
        "unchanged"
      ]
    },
    "input": {
      "minLength": 1,
      "type": "string"
    },
    "kernel": {
      "pattern": "^conformance\\.kernel\\.(recovery|recovered-from-prose|response-verdict)$",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "rewrite": {
      "minLength": 3,
      "type": "string"
    },
    "rewritten": {
      "minLength": 1,
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "kernel",
    "input",
    "rewritten",
    "expect",
    "rewrite",
    "cell"
  ],
  "type": "object"
}